                        "review": "A clever mix of a board game and a turn-based RPG.\n\nThis game is a ton of fun if you've got a few friends to play with. I'm a big fan of quite a few board games, especially ones like The Game of Life and Monopoly and I found this one to be extremely fun given the right company. I'm a bit weary on the end game bonus points but hell, it's all in good fun and it adds to the overall suspense of the game. Top marks for this one.",
